## Deck:   US standard card deck -- with its two jokers too, if its with jokers is yes

a deck is a list of cards

// with jokers:  yes to add the red and the black joker when it's set up, after the 52 cards
a deck has with jokers as yes or no

to set up a deck
	if  the is-set-up of it return
	for each rank in card ranks
		for each suit in card suits
			get a new card with rank = the rank, suit = the suit
			add it to the deck
	if the with jokers of the deck
		get a new joker with color = red
		add it to the deck
		get a new joker with color = black
		add it to the deck
	set the is-set-up of the deck to yes

to display a deck
	set card-names to a new list
	for each card in the deck
		add the short name of the card to card-names
	echo "deck: " + card-names

to test deck creation
	the deck is a new deck
	set up the deck
	expect the number of cards in the deck to be 52
	set up the deck
	expect the number of cards in the deck to be 52
	set the queens to the cards in the deck where the rank of the card is "queen" 
	expect the number of cards in the queens to be 4
	expect the name of the bottom card of the deck to be "king-of-spades"
	expect the short name of the top card of the deck to be "A♣️"

	echo "the deck before shuffling:"
	display the deck
	expect the first card of the deck is the ace of clubs to be yes

	shuffle the deck
	shuffle the deck

	echo "the deck after shuffling:"
	display the deck
test deck creation

to test deck with jokers
	the deck is a new deck whose with jokers is yes
	set up the deck
	expect the number of cards in the deck to be 54
	set the jokers to the cards in the deck where the card is a joker
	expect the number of cards in the jokers to be 2
	expect the last card of the deck is the black joker to be yes
	expect the first card of the deck is the ace of clubs to be yes
test deck with jokers